From e149154da549f8339a48147015cc33cc230c8dd1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alex Perrin <44126061+AlexPerrin@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 07:04:14 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] Hunter: bird snares and box traps

Lay a bird snare or box trap (Hunter level per trap and creature, 1-5 traps at Hunter
1/20/40/60/80); every 3 ticks a set trap with a matching creature within 2 tiles rolls the
catch on the crimson swift's skilling curve (wiki) at the player's level above the creature's
requirement; the trap goes through the trapping/failing locs to full or broken. Check gives
the loot, the trap and the XP ("You've caught a <creature>."), Dismantle/Reset/Investigate.
Five birds (crimson swift to tropical wagtail) and ferrets/chinchompas (grey, red, black).
dbtables hunter_traps (60011) and hunter_trap_creatures (60012), rows 60350-60360, timer 470.
Trap locs are the ones RuneLite's Hunter plugin tracks. Collapse after 200 ticks, the
catch curve for creatures other than the crimson swift and most messages are best guesses.
Integration tests.
